# Community Membership
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Community — third case instance of the many-to-many join shape (CAP-F20),
# after Case 11's Follow and Like. Also awards Points on Join.
# Case 12 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: community-group.menata, community-points.menata

Membership

Fields

- Group : Group
- Member : User
- Role : Member | Admin
- Joined At : Date

Events

When Join

    Award Points for Joined Group

Constraints

- Group is required.
- Member is required.

    A Member may join a given Group only once.

Permissions

Member

- Join
- Leave

Views

- Group Members : List
- My Groups : List
